1
00:00:07,343 --> 00:00:08,511
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:09,222 --> 00:00:12,475
<c.simplifiedchinese>你就是斋藤一身后的真正指使者</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:13,147 --> 00:00:15,691
<c.simplifiedchinese>前萨摩藩维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:15,777 --> 00:00:17,821
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治政府内务卿</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:17,906 --> 00:00:19,700
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保利通</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:25,379 --> 00:00:29,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>说了一串我也没懂
这老头到底谁啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:29,095 --> 00:00:32,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>小屁孩连报纸都不看 当然不认识</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:32,895 --> 00:00:36,815
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是与西乡隆盛、桂小五郎并列</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:36,903 --> 00:00:41,657
<c.simplifiedchinese>对明治维新贡献最大的
维新三杰的最后一位</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:45,708
<c.simplifiedchinese>管理国家一切事物的内务省领导人</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:45,796 --> 00:00:49,591
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说…是日本最有权势的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:50,304 --> 00:00:52,598
<c.simplifiedchinese>很抱歉如此粗暴的对待</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:53,477 --> 00:00:58,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们无论如何都必须了解你的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:59,072 --> 00:01:00,990
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以听我讲讲事情原委吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:01:02,078 --> 00:01:05,081
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以 就算要逼你说出来也行</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:01:06,754 --> 00:01:08,548
<c.simplifiedchinese>这事太大了</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:01:08,633 --> 00:01:12,679
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然跟内务卿大久保
这样的大人物有关</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:01:12,766 --> 00:01:15,102
<c.simplifiedchinese>这可不止是拔刀斋的事了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:01:19,404 --> 00:01:23,700
<c.simplifiedchinese>真扫兴啊 我们的胜负就留到下次吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:01:23,788 --> 00:01:25,665
<c.simplifiedchinese>你捡回了一条命</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:01:25,750 --> 00:01:27,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>你才是</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:01:32,723 --> 00:01:33,640
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤！</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:01:34,309 --> 00:01:35,518
<c.simplifiedchinese>任务报告</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:01:36,104 --> 00:01:39,774
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心根本无法指望</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:01:39,862 --> 00:01:43,616
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是绯村拔刀斋似乎还可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:01:43,703 --> 00:01:44,746
<c.simplifiedchinese>报告完毕</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:01:45,916 --> 00:01:48,168
<c.simplifiedchinese>那家伙可真是</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:01:48,253 --> 00:01:50,756
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明是警视厅的密探</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:01:50,842 --> 00:01:54,638
<c.simplifiedchinese>但对于壬生狼的想法 我真是不明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:01:54,725 --> 00:01:57,394
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村 跟我们来</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,481
<c.simplifiedchinese>别傻了</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:01:58,565 --> 00:02:01,985
<c.simplifiedchinese>这件事关系到的不仅我一个人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:02:03,492 --> 00:02:04,534
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:02:08,753 --> 00:02:13,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>这件事关系到的…不止在下一个</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:02:13,512 --> 00:02:16,431
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的话要这里的所有人一起听</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:02:17,228 --> 00:02:18,562
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下…</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:02:20,109 --> 00:02:23,654
<c.simplifiedchinese>太好了 你又恢复原样了 剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:02:23,740 --> 00:02:24,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:02:26,079 --> 00:02:26,997
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保卿…</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:02:27,081 --> 00:02:28,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在做什么啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:02:28,250 --> 00:02:29,418
<c.simplifiedchinese>照他说的做</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:02:30,087 --> 00:02:33,048
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们无论如何都需要绯村的帮忙</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:02:33,135 --> 00:02:36,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:02:38,770 --> 00:02:42,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:13,585 --> 00:04:16,463
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村 我就直接说正题了</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:17,051 --> 00:04:19,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄正在京都暗中活动</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:21,351 --> 00:04:24,979
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么直接说正题啊 大久保？</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:25,067 --> 00:04:26,568
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄是谁啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:26,653 --> 00:04:28,780
<c.simplifiedchinese>说话放尊重点！</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:28,865 --> 00:04:30,742
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄真实</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:31,329 --> 00:04:35,750
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下开始做游击剑士
结束了刽子手的地下活动后</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:35,837 --> 00:04:38,507
<c.simplifiedchinese>另一位长州派维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:38,593 --> 00:04:40,887
<c.simplifiedchinese>成为了替身刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:41,891 --> 00:04:45,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是刽子手拔刀斋的后继者</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:47,194 --> 00:04:52,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>他隐藏得很好
几乎没人知道他的存在</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:52,997 --> 00:04:56,875
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使在下是前任刽子手
也没有亲眼见过他</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:56,963 --> 00:04:59,591
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过这是怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:59,677 --> 00:05:02,847
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说他在十年前的戊辰战争中死了</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:06,774 --> 00:05:07,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:08,069 --> 00:05:12,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄没有死在战争里
是被同志暗杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:15,125 --> 00:05:16,835
<c.simplifiedchinese>为防止消息外泄</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:16,919 --> 00:05:21,215
<c.simplifiedchinese>秘密处理掉执行黑暗任务的人
以确保万无一失</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:25,184
<c.simplifiedchinese>在那个时代并不罕见</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:25,896 --> 00:05:32,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄真实不论是剑术还是头脑
都和你不分上下</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:33,203 --> 00:05:38,917
<c.simplifiedchinese>但却有着他人难以理解的强烈功名心
是个很危险的人物</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:42,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>他担任替身刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:42,221 --> 00:05:46,016
<c.simplifiedchinese>也只是为了向维新志士的领导人
证明自己的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:46,103 --> 00:05:49,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果他的暗杀行动被世人所知</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:49,193 --> 00:05:53,114
<c.simplifiedchinese>甚至会动摇明治政府的统治根基</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:53,201 --> 00:05:56,746
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄如果活着迎来了新时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:56,833 --> 00:06:00,086
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一定会抓住这个弱点</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:00,173 --> 00:06:04,344
<c.simplifiedchinese>将日本玩弄于股掌之中</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:04,432 --> 00:06:08,477
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此趁着戊辰战争的混乱之际杀了他</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:08,565 --> 00:06:09,941
<c.simplifiedchinese>对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:10,444 --> 00:06:12,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊 我们的确杀了他</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:12,865 --> 00:06:16,535
<c.simplifiedchinese>甚至还给尸体浇上油放了一把火</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:17,499 --> 00:06:20,752
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而尽管全身被烧伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:23,383
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄真实还是活了下来</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:24,095 --> 00:06:28,641
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在他暗中集结了一群反叛之徒</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:28,730 --> 00:06:32,400
<c.simplifiedchinese>组成了一个大军团 以京都为据点</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:32,488 --> 00:06:37,117
<c.simplifiedchinese>策划着将国家一分为二的复仇之战</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:38,081 --> 00:06:41,752
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们派遣过许多讨伐队
结果都全灭了</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:42,424 --> 00:06:45,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>你几乎是我们最后的指望了</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:46,265 --> 00:06:49,143
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了这个国家的所有人</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:49,229 --> 00:06:52,273
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村 再去一次京都吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:55,534 --> 00:06:56,576
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:56,661 --> 00:07:01,040
<c.simplifiedchinese>你希望剑心去暗杀志志雄真实？</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:07:02,673 --> 00:07:04,258
<c.simplifiedchinese>是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:07:04,343 --> 00:07:06,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然 报酬十分丰厚</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:07:06,681 --> 00:07:11,686
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且我们会对一些过去的违法行为
睁一只眼闭一只眼</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:11,774 --> 00:07:16,404
<c.simplifiedchinese>比如说赦免贩卖鸦片的高荷惠无罪</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:16,492 --> 00:07:17,785
<c.simplifiedchinese>开什么玩笑？</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:18,371 --> 00:07:22,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>与其让你们拿这个交易条件要挟剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:22,128 --> 00:07:25,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>我宁愿选择上死刑台</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:26,804 --> 00:07:31,934
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是说
你们自己卑劣行为招来的后果</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:32,023 --> 00:07:37,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>却要剑心来擦屁股 太自私了吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:37,534 --> 00:07:39,995
<c.simplifiedchinese>无知小子不要口出狂言！</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:42,291
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是关系明治政府存亡的危机时刻！</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:42,377 --> 00:07:45,631
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种卑鄙的政府干脆倒台算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:46,134 --> 00:07:50,722
<c.simplifiedchinese>本来也只是给
好好过日子的平民百姓添麻烦罢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:50,810 --> 00:07:53,146
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有明治政府的繁荣</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:53,231 --> 00:07:55,692
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪来平民的和平生活！</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:55,779 --> 00:07:57,697
<c.simplifiedchinese>那只是你们自负而已！</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:57,783 --> 00:07:59,993
<c.simplifiedchinese>再不闭嘴我就逮捕你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,497
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你试试看 秃头！</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:01,582 --> 00:08:04,502
<c.simplifiedchinese>有一件事就算我是个小孩也听懂了</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:05,172 --> 00:08:07,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果出了差错 你们也有可能</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:08,053 --> 00:08:11,139
<c.simplifiedchinese>像抹杀志志雄一样杀了剑心 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:11,811 --> 00:08:13,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管是过去还是现在</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:13,188 --> 00:08:16,358
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们都自顾自地决定暗杀谁抹杀谁</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:16,988 --> 00:08:19,740
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们这群大叔真可笑啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:21,329 --> 00:08:22,747
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保卿</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:22,833 --> 00:08:27,879
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明白你需要刽子手拔刀斋的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:27,968 --> 00:08:31,930
<c.simplifiedchinese>但剑心现在只是个不杀人的浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:32,602 --> 00:08:36,273
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们绝对不会让剑心去京都的</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:40,367 --> 00:08:43,245
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！你们知道事情有多重大吗…</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:43,331 --> 00:08:45,083
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了 川路</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:51,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>给你一周时间考虑</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:51,139 --> 00:08:53,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>一周后5月14日</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:54,437 --> 00:08:56,773
<c.simplifiedchinese>我再来听你的答复</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:01,494 --> 00:09:02,953
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:04,792 --> 00:09:07,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看起来比十年前憔悴许多啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:09,258 --> 00:09:11,719
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起结束旧时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:11,806 --> 00:09:14,975
<c.simplifiedchinese>建构起一个新时代更难</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:15,479 --> 00:09:17,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是这么回事</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:17,692 --> 00:09:19,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>我期待你的肯定答复</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:19,530 --> 00:09:21,323
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:27,838 --> 00:09:29,840
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保利通！</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:29,925 --> 00:09:32,928
<c.simplifiedchinese>我得去安全的上海躲躲风头</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:33,014 --> 00:09:34,349
<c.simplifiedchinese>听到没？</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:34,433 --> 00:09:37,395
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道一个比上海还安全的地方</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:41,239 --> 00:09:43,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就是地狱</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:45,247 --> 00:09:47,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然你们维新志士以为</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:47,251 --> 00:09:50,963
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治时代是你们一手建造的</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:51,050 --> 00:09:53,887
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们幕府的人也以失败者的角色</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:53,973 --> 00:09:58,186
<c.simplifiedchinese>为开创明治时代赌上了自己的人生</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:58,273 --> 00:10:01,443
<c.simplifiedchinese>我之所以服从政府成为了密探</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:01,529 --> 00:10:04,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>清除以明治时代为食的蛀虫</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:04,368 --> 00:10:08,623
<c.simplifiedchinese>是为了践行活在明治的新选组的责任</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:08,711 --> 00:10:11,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管是大久保还是谁</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:11,549 --> 00:10:15,887
<c.simplifiedchinese>沉溺于一己私欲
给这个国家的人带来灾难的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:15,975 --> 00:10:18,353
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会遵行“恶即斩”原则统统斩杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:18,438 --> 00:10:21,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 不管多少钱我都给你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:21,904 --> 00:10:24,114
<c.simplifiedchinese>你可以用食物驯养狗</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:27,411
<c.simplifiedchinese>用金钱驯养人 但是</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:27,498 --> 00:10:31,335
<c.simplifiedchinese>你永远无法驯养壬生狼</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:38,186 --> 00:10:39,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>狼始终是狼</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:40,565 --> 00:10:42,734
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组始终是新选组</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:43,781 --> 00:10:47,201
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像刽子手始终是刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:49,542 --> 00:10:52,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说的对吧 拔刀斋？</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:11:03,153 --> 00:11:05,030
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 洗得干干净净</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:11:05,115 --> 00:11:06,491
<c.simplifiedchinese>-喂
-哦啰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:11:07,578 --> 00:11:10,122
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下差点就死了</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:10,208 --> 00:11:13,128
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在是悠悠闲闲洗衣服的时候吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:13,214 --> 00:11:14,716
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的回答考虑怎么样了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:14,801 --> 00:11:17,596
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是别理会吧 那些奇怪的废话</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:11:17,681 --> 00:11:21,935
<c.simplifiedchinese>那种只想着私利的政府官员</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:22,024 --> 00:11:24,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本不值得信任</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:25,489 --> 00:11:29,159
<c.simplifiedchinese>你心里还是反感明治政府啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:11:29,246 --> 00:11:32,625
<c.simplifiedchinese>-对 不行吗？
-没什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:11:33,129 --> 00:11:36,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>但如果大久保卿是只关心私利的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:37,721 --> 00:11:40,140
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤早就杀掉他了</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:41,562 --> 00:11:43,689
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个恶劣警官吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:43,776 --> 00:11:45,694
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不是政府的走狗吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:46,782 --> 00:11:51,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤在和在下交手时提到了正义</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:52,584 --> 00:11:54,753
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果他堕落成了政府的走狗</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:57,968
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是不会说出那些话的</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:58,763 --> 00:12:02,308
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个男人直到现在仍然像壬生狼那样</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:12:03,148 --> 00:12:08,236
<c.simplifiedchinese>在阳光照不到的黑暗中
贯彻“恶即斩”的原则</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:12:10,245 --> 00:12:13,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此他也不是能和睦相处的人啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:12:13,878 --> 00:12:16,130
<c.simplifiedchinese>-是啊
-当然了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:12:16,215 --> 00:12:17,508
<c.simplifiedchinese>我超讨厌他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:12:20,599 --> 00:12:23,351
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 真不卫生啊 藤田先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:12:23,438 --> 00:12:24,439
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:25,192 --> 00:12:28,987
<c.simplifiedchinese>四次 看来真的很讨厌我</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:29,074 --> 00:12:30,659
<c.simplifiedchinese>算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:30,744 --> 00:12:34,164
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管到了什么时代
新选组都注定会被讨厌</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:35,712 --> 00:12:36,588
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:37,591 --> 00:12:38,550
<c.simplifiedchinese>你会怎么办呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:38,635 --> 00:12:40,470
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋？</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:12:44,313 --> 00:12:47,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下接下来要去大久保卿那里了</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:48,906 --> 00:12:49,573
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:49,657 --> 00:12:51,951
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说他会过来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:52,037 --> 00:12:55,624
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保卿毕竟事务繁忙</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:55,710 --> 00:12:57,963
<c.simplifiedchinese>-还有…
-你在啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:58,549 --> 00:12:59,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>早 阿剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:59,928 --> 00:13:04,432
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天说好要给答复的
我很在意就过来看看</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:06,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢你的关心</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:13:06,565 --> 00:13:10,695
<c.simplifiedchinese>-不过在下马上就要出门了
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:13:10,782 --> 00:13:13,451
<c.simplifiedchinese>你知道大久保的宅邸在哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:13:13,538 --> 00:13:18,209
<c.simplifiedchinese>不知道
但听说他今天要去赤坂的太政官</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:18,298 --> 00:13:21,009
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果去纪尾井坂那边大概会遇到他吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:21,095 --> 00:13:23,055
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我们也一起…</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:23,141 --> 00:13:28,062
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 情况复杂 在下一个人去比较好</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:32,326 --> 00:13:35,829
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心不会抛下你去京都的</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:35,915 --> 00:13:40,337
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦说得对
现在那家伙不会再参加什么暗杀的</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:40,425 --> 00:13:43,219
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也绝不会让他走的</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:45,769 --> 00:13:46,978
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:53,493 --> 00:13:56,871
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村果真会行动吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:58,544 --> 00:14:01,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 他必须行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:14:04,306 --> 00:14:08,477
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果他不行动 这个国家就要灭亡了</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:14:10,026 --> 00:14:14,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>将死之人就不必担心国家的未来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:14:18,751 --> 00:14:20,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是志志雄大人的口信</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:21,632 --> 00:14:27,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>“派绯村拔刀斋来杀我这个主意不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:27,185 --> 00:14:29,187
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过你还是白忙一场</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:14:29,273 --> 00:14:31,275
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个国家我就收下了”</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:14:31,944 --> 00:14:32,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>就这些</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:14:38,416 --> 00:14:40,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>石川县武士 岛田一郎！</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:14:41,004 --> 00:14:43,006
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是石川县的长连豪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:14:43,092 --> 00:14:45,470
<c.simplifiedchinese>奸贼大久保 受死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:14:47,434 --> 00:14:48,935
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保！</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:50,482 --> 00:14:53,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>他已经死了</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:53,821 --> 00:14:56,365
<c.simplifiedchinese>在我们之前被别人杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:56,452 --> 00:15:00,748
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们已经向政府和新闻界发了斩奸状</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:15:01,337 --> 00:15:03,255
<c.simplifiedchinese>没办法了</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:15:03,925 --> 00:15:08,012
<c.simplifiedchinese>-大久保就是我们杀的
-岛田</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:15:10,188 --> 00:15:14,108
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有别的目击者
大久保就是我们七个杀的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:15:16,450 --> 00:15:18,077
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错！</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:15:19,289 --> 00:15:22,584
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治11年5月14日</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:15:22,671 --> 00:15:24,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>纪尾井坂之变</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:15:24,758 --> 00:15:27,052
<c.simplifiedchinese>站在明治权力顶点的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:15:27,137 --> 00:15:30,558
<c.simplifiedchinese>在光天化日下被刺杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:15:30,645 --> 00:15:35,316
<c.simplifiedchinese>就这样行凶者
被认为是心怀不满的石川县武士团体</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:15:35,405 --> 00:15:39,826
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄一派的存在未被世人知晓</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:41,082 --> 00:15:42,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保先生…</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:43,379 --> 00:15:47,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也一样 想要保住性命
就不要跟志志雄大人作对</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:54,066 --> 00:15:56,152
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄真实…</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:57,949 --> 00:15:59,868
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是志志雄的风格！</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:16:00,538 --> 00:16:02,582
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们从不会亲自露面</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:16:02,667 --> 00:16:07,422
<c.simplifiedchinese>直到造反的那天为止
慢慢地削弱明治政府的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:16:08,971 --> 00:16:10,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保卿…</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:16:12,854 --> 00:16:14,105
<c.simplifiedchinese>打扰了</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:16:14,190 --> 00:16:17,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是福岛县令山吉先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:16:17,572 --> 00:16:20,700
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后一个跟大久保卿谈话的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:16:20,787 --> 00:16:23,539
<c.simplifiedchinese>在东京会议之后</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:16:23,626 --> 00:16:27,380
<c.simplifiedchinese>今早我来大久保宅拜访</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:16:29,471 --> 00:16:32,432
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新已经过去了十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:16:32,519 --> 00:16:36,648
<c.simplifiedchinese>要说有什么成就
很惭愧 但我们实绩实在太少</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:16:37,236 --> 00:16:38,862
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过 重点在于今后</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:16:40,158 --> 00:16:44,705
<c.simplifiedchinese>巩固一个新兴国家的基础
必须要三十年的时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:16:45,293 --> 00:16:49,047
<c.simplifiedchinese>之前的十年是第一期创业阶段</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:49,678 --> 00:16:52,472
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来的十年就是发展阶段</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:52,559 --> 00:16:56,187
<c.simplifiedchinese>要整顿内政 让国家基础完备</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:56,274 --> 00:16:58,526
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是最重要的时期</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:59,196 --> 00:17:02,867
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不才 但第二个十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:17:02,954 --> 00:17:05,248
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想排除万难达成目标</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:17:06,085 --> 00:17:10,631
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后的第三个守成阶段
就要交给后继者了</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:14,223
<c.simplifiedchinese>召开议会 将政体向国民政治过度</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:17:15,020 --> 00:17:18,940
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后日本会变成一个国民国家</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:17:19,028 --> 00:17:22,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治维新就真的完成了</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:17:23,369 --> 00:17:27,290
<c.simplifiedchinese>国民国家吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:17:27,377 --> 00:17:31,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>不再由统治者替他们做决定</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:17:31,219 --> 00:17:34,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是一个由国民自己来选择前进道路</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:17:35,478 --> 00:17:37,647
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是很远大的理想啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:37,732 --> 00:17:40,735
<c.simplifiedchinese>但却是足以相信的理想</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:17:42,074 --> 00:17:44,743
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果大久保卿还在的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:45,790 --> 00:17:47,416
<c.simplifiedchinese>号外！</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:17:48,002 --> 00:17:50,880
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保被暗杀！内务卿被暗杀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:17:50,967 --> 00:17:52,969
<c.simplifiedchinese>号外！</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:17:53,054 --> 00:17:58,351
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们就这样失去了最后一位维新三杰
也失去了最伟大的指导者</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:02,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>政治界只剩平庸之辈</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:18:04,285 --> 00:18:08,539
<c.simplifiedchinese>从今天开始 日本陷入了迷途</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:18:09,128 --> 00:18:12,715
<c.simplifiedchinese>而志志雄绝不会放过这个机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:18:14,764 --> 00:18:18,727
<c.simplifiedchinese>时代的车轮再度开始转动</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:18:22,780 --> 00:18:26,201
<c.simplifiedchinese>偏偏这么晚了还有急诊病人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:18:26,287 --> 00:18:28,414
<c.simplifiedchinese>我送她们到马车那边</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:30,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 小心点</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:18:35,723 --> 00:18:38,142
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…还不回来…</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:18:40,524 --> 00:18:42,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:18:48,624 --> 00:18:50,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>-弥彦呢？
-啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:18:50,962 --> 00:18:51,837
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;（神谷活心流 剑术道场）</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:18:51,922 --> 00:18:53,757
<c.simplifiedchinese>他等得太累睡着了</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:18:54,343 --> 00:18:55,219
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:58,100
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:18:58,686 --> 00:19:01,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保卿今天早上被暗杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:19:01,566 --> 00:19:04,152
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道…我听到了号外</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:19:04,906 --> 00:19:07,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的凶手是志志雄</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:19:09,164 --> 00:19:12,084
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能再这样放任他们不管</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:19:13,131 --> 00:19:15,550
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下要去京都</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:19:20,353 --> 00:19:23,648
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要去暗杀志志雄真实吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:19:23,736 --> 00:19:25,321
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:19:25,405 --> 00:19:27,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过还不确定</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:19:28,871 --> 00:19:33,167
<c.simplifiedchinese>来到道场后 一直过着放松的日子</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:19:33,254 --> 00:19:39,344
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下甚至以为真的可以
从刽子手变成一介普通剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:19:40,518 --> 00:19:41,561
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:19:41,646 --> 00:19:47,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟斋藤的战斗让在下明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:19:47,532 --> 00:19:52,662
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下的心里其实没有任何变化
还住着一个疯狂的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:19:52,752 --> 00:19:55,129
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是你很快就会变回来的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:19:55,215 --> 00:19:58,760
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算你变得再怎么接近拔刀斋
剑心还是剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:19:58,847 --> 00:20:02,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫和斋藤两次都是这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:20:03,064 --> 00:20:04,399
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:20:04,901 --> 00:20:06,194
<c.simplifiedchinese>并不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:20:07,489 --> 00:20:08,824
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫那次</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:20:08,909 --> 00:20:12,204
<c.simplifiedchinese>一心想着救你 在下才变成了刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:20:12,959 --> 00:20:15,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>听到薰小姐的声音又恢复了理智</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:20:15,630 --> 00:20:17,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是和斋藤交手时</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:20:18,010 --> 00:20:20,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下变回拔刀斋只是为了战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:20:21,517 --> 00:20:24,937
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以根本听不到薰小姐的声音</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:20:25,985 --> 00:20:27,862
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是完全不同的</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:20:30,076 --> 00:20:32,495
<c.simplifiedchinese>时代的车轮再度开始转动</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:20:34,126 --> 00:20:36,044
<c.simplifiedchinese>初见时</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:20:36,130 --> 00:20:39,175
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使知道在下是刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:20:39,261 --> 00:20:41,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐仍然做出挽留</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:20:42,184 --> 00:20:46,021
<c.simplifiedchinese>“我不在乎别人的过去” 你说</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:20:48,029 --> 00:20:49,530
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下真的很高兴</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:20:51,953 --> 00:20:53,997
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果继续留在这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:20:54,082 --> 00:20:57,669
<c.simplifiedchinese>会屡屡让你们涉险</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:20:57,756 --> 00:21:01,801
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下也会一次次变成拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:21:02,516 --> 00:21:06,061
<c.simplifiedchinese>何况对于政府 对于志志雄</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:21:06,148 --> 00:21:10,778
<c.simplifiedchinese>以及国内众多
憎恨刽子手拔刀斋的人来说</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:21:10,866 --> 00:21:13,994
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下永远都只是拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:21:14,874 --> 00:21:18,294
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不能再留在这里了</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:21:23,307 --> 00:21:26,811
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你一直以来的照顾 那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:21:27,566 --> 00:21:28,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>再见了</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:21:30,154 --> 00:21:31,573
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:21:32,325 --> 00:21:35,537
<c.simplifiedchinese>要再度…启程了</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:21:49,693 --> 00:21:52,154
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:21:57,667 --> 00:22:00,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:22:02,177 --> 00:22:05,555
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治11年5月14日</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:22:05,642 --> 00:22:10,271
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心再次成为浪客踏上旅途</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:22:10,360 --> 00:22:14,656
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个人独自消失在了漆黑的暗夜里</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:22:16,455 --> 00:22:18,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋去哪了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:22,047
<c.simplifiedchinese>那把日本刀我就拿来抵给你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:22:22,759 --> 00:22:26,888
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么多年杳无音信 你现在露面</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:22:26,976 --> 00:22:29,145
<c.simplifiedchinese>找我究竟有什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:22:29,231 --> 00:22:31,942
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄大人在等你</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:22:32,028 --> 00:22:33,571
<c.simplifiedchinese>这边请</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:22:35,034 --> 00:22:36,369
<c.simplifiedchinese>你就是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:22:37,038 --> 00:22:39,457
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄真实</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:22:41,422 --> 00:22:43,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少叫一声同志吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:22:43,969 --> 00:22:46,179
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是没礼貌的前辈</c.simplifiedchinese>

